# Allowlist: nothing goes into the build context unless it is listed below (Sean's PR #3 review, item 2).
# Scripts, tests, docs, the local agent packages and every .env file stay out of the image. The one exception is the
# operator script, scripts/align-admin.mjs (it imports only lib/v2/core.mts, lib/v2/retention-core.mts and
# lib/v2/metrics-core.mts, under lib).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!app
!lib
!public
!proxy.ts
!instrumentation.ts
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!scripts/align-admin.mjs
# Belt and braces inside the allowed folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/node_modules
**/.next
